Certificates for the inverse cycles in ATLAS F23G1-p31671B0.
Support masks certify disjointness; the individual cycle checks certify the
lookup action, including its orientation. All numerical checks use the kernel.
The consumer is the GLS3 Table 5.3u Fi23 candidate.
-/

@[expose] public section
